        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 29-B1, Clear Glass Half Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple yet beautiful, the Clear Glass Knob With Stepped Rose, uses traditional silhouettes paired with the unexpected shine of clear glass in a nod to the glamor of the old world. Stark, this lovely glass knobset really captures the essence of timelessness, perfect for any space that needs a dramatic piece to bring it together. The Fusion made 29-B1 Clear Glass Half Round Knob with Stepped Rose is available in 5 finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Half-Round Glass Knob with Traditional Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion 29 B1 Flat Iron Glass Knob with Stepped Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Clear Glass Knob With Stepped Rose, Fusion 29-B1",
                "description": "Fusion 29-B1, Simple Clear Glass Knob With Stepped Rose - Simple yet beautiful, the Clear Glass Knob With Stepped Rose, uses traditional silhouettes paired with the unexpected shine of clear glass in a nod to the glamor of the old world. Stark, this lovely glass knobset really captures the essence of timelessness, perfect for any space that needs a dramatic piece to bring it together. The Fusion made 29-B1 Clear Glass Half Round Knob with Stepped Rose is available in 5 finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
